<div style="margin-top:4pt;"><font style="color:#333333;font-family:Arial Narrow;font-size:10pt;">The Fund seeks total return which exceeds that of the Bloomberg </font><font style="color:#333333;font-family:Arial Narrow;font-size:10pt;">Commodity
